アフターダーク 夜の巣ね
After dark, a nest of the night...

45
00:08:27,288 --> 00:08:30,588
狂い泣いた アストージナ
...crying madly, Astorgina.

46
00:08:30,788 --> 00:08:33,588
肝心なのは其の生身
What matters is that raw flesh...

47
00:08:33,588 --> 00:08:36,788
脱ぎ捨てて 騒いで行く先には
...casting it off, heading where we make a ruckus.

48
