105
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:43,380
震える胸をどらした過去も
even the past that made my heart tremble,

106
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:45,570
退屈な毎日も
even boring everyday life...

107
00:15:45,570 --> 00:15:48,000
カウンセリング、嫌い嫌い
Counseling? I hate it, I hate it!

108
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:50,360
ここんとこ大ピンチ
I'm in a huge pinch right now.

109
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:53,890
あ、HAPPY LUCKY アンデッド
Ah, happy, lucky, UNDEAD!

110
00:16:01,242 --> 00:16:03,292
ねぇねぇねぇねぇ、なんとかして
Hey, hey, hey, hey, do something about it!

111
00:16:03,292 --> 00:16:06,472
戦ってるようなそんな気がするの
It feels like I'm constantly fighting.

112
00:16:06,472 --> 00:16:09,082
そここの自分、すっかりしんでる
This self of mine is completely dead,

113
00:16:09,082 --> 00:16:12,092
透明なボレロで耐えていた
enduring it in a transparent bolero.

114
00:16:12,092 --> 00:16:14,732
痛い痛い痛い、記憶の奥
It hurts, hurts, hurts, deep in my memories.

115
00:16:14,732 --> 00:16:18,342
残念、もういないのに、あれ? そっちがいいアイロニー
Too bad they're not here anymore... Huh? Is that irony better?

116
00:16:18,342 --> 00:16:21,552
ねぇ、すかされてるのは、今の自分なの?
Hey, am I the one being brushed off right now?

117
00:16:21,552 --> 00:16:24,552
消えないでてる家業はコンプレックス
The un-fading family business is a complex,

118
00:16:24,552 --> 00:16:28,022
塗りつかされてるみたい
like it's being painted over.

119
00:16:28,022 --> 00:16:31,002
巻き付いたまま、まだ離れない
Still wrapped around me, refusing to leave—

120
00:16:31,002 --> 00:16:34,402
愛し日々の自分、アンデッド
my beloved daily self, UNDEAD!

121
00:16:34,402 --> 00:16:38,312
神じゃない、おまえと前の連鎖
It's not God; the chain between you and the past

122
00:16:38,312 --> 00:16:41,232
生きているガットとワルツを踊り続ける頑固さ
and the stubbornness to keep dancing waltzes with living guts.

123
00:16:41,232 --> 00:16:44,262
すっごおりに甘んじて満足するなよ
Don't just surrender to it and be satisfied!

124
00:16:44,262 --> 00:16:48,172
真夜中はデリラを落としちゃうなんてヒュダ!
To think midnight would drop Delilah... how bold!

125
00:16:48,172 --> 00:16:51,312
この夜、この世は、近距離ファンタジー
This night, this world is a close-range fantasy.

126
00:16:51,312 --> 00:16:54,622
次は俺が出せるか、勝てるかで
Next is whether I can put it out or win,

127
00:16:54,622 --> 00:16:58,252
出会って出会って、やっと始まる物語
meeting and meeting, the story finally begins.

128
00:16:58,252 --> 00:17:02,052
先とか化け物のがその球体ピース
The future or the monster is that spherical piece.

129
00:17:02,052 --> 00:17:07,972
Ah, Future can change the past. Past and future, love for the future.

130
00:17:08,102 --> 00:17:10,112
ねぇねぇねぇねぇ、どうして
Hey, hey, hey, hey, why is it

131
00:17:10,112 --> 00:17:13,002
未来になりなんとなんの
that as the future approaches...

132
00:17:13,002 --> 00:17:15,762
最低限の余裕気がして
feeling a minimum of composure,

133
00:17:15,762 --> 00:17:18,802
もうずいぶん生きてる気がしてテンプレート職種
feeling like I've lived for so long, a template profession.

134
00:17:18,802 --> 00:17:21,542
不適なんて機ことの気配もない
